# live-build options only the arm64 image takes, one to a line; build.sh hands them to
# `lb config`. Debian 13's kernel (6.12) is older than the ARM laptops patina can boot
# (devices/snapdragon-x-elite/), so the arm64 image takes its kernel from
# trixie-backports (arm64.pref.chroot), for the live system and, since the installer
# copies it, the installed one, whose apt sources keep trixie-backports for its updates.
--backports true
